{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t朝中社報道，朝鮮昨日在東部海域進行兩種潛射戰略巡航導彈試射。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道說，試射目標在檢查朝鮮水下戰鬥系統的常態化動員狀態，提升海軍執行戰略任務能力，並有效展示戰爭遏制手段的可靠性和能力。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.734912+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T00:40:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:18:10.334082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:12.822504+00:00","content_hash":"2376fa120d8446ea18c320ad0afe0dd2508f866086877d8c67c1bc800e06345a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}